# Documents not migrated to the new documentation standard yet (issue #1257), and files kept out of the wiki.
#
# A path listed here is not linted by scripts/wiki:lint and is not published to the GitHub Wiki.
# Patterns are relative to docs/ (fnmatch: `*` also matches `/`).
#
# Code directories of the experiments: their README.md describes the code next to it (how to run it), the write-up is
# the Experiment-*.md page one level up. These stay here for good.
experiments/*/*
